---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  titleOverride="Custom Home Builders in Ashiyana, Lucknow | VP Infra"
  description="VP Infra builds custom homes in Ashiyana, Lucknow with expert design, quality materials & on-time delivery. ISO certified. Contact us at 8840069902."
>
  <section class="page-header text-center" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.82), rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.82)), url('/images/custom_home_builders_ashiyana_lucknow.webp');">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="fade-in-up">Custom Home Builders in Ashiyana, Lucknow</h1>
      <p class="fade-in-up mt-4">Your plot in Ashiyana deserves a home designed exactly the way you imagined it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-details">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid gap-8 service-grid">
        <div class="service-content fade-in-up">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Custom Homes Built for Ashiyana Living</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">Ashiyana Colony is one of Lucknow's most established residential neighbourhoods. Families here have roots. The plots are well-sized, the streets are familiar, and the community is close-knit. When you build your custom home in Ashiyana, Lucknow, you are not just constructing a building. You are placing your family in a place that already has character.</p>
          <p class="mb-4">Our registered office is at M-652, Sector-M, Ashiyana Colony itself. We have built homes across Sector-M, Sector-I, Sector-H, and surrounding areas. We know the soil here, the LDA approval requirements specific to Ashiyana plots, and the typical plot sizes that most families work with.</p>

          <h3 class="mt-8 mb-4">What Makes Our Custom Home Service Different</h3>
          <ul class="benefits-list">
            <li><strong>Design from Scratch:</strong> No template floor plans. Your architect creates a layout that works for how you actually live.</li>
            <li><strong>Vastu Consultation:</strong> We incorporate Vastu Shastra guidelines into your floor plan without compromising structural integrity or wasting usable space.</li>
            <li><strong>Material Selection Support:</strong> From brick type to flooring finish, our team guides you through choices with clear cost implications stated upfront.</li>
            <li><strong>Plot-Specific Structural Design:</strong> Our engineer conducts a soil test before designing the foundation to ensure stability specific to your Ashiyana plot.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="mt-8 mb-4">Our Process for Custom Homes in Ashiyana</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">It starts with a conversation, not a quotation. We visit your plot, check its dimensions and orientation, and discuss your needs and budget in plain terms. We then produce three floor plan options for your review. Once you select one, we prepare working drawings and handle your LDA building permission. Construction begins only after you have approved the structural design in full.</p>
          <p class="mb-4">During construction, you receive two site visit invitations per month. Any change you want goes through a formal change order with a revised cost and timeline so there are no verbal commitments that create confusion later.</p>

          <h3 class="mt-8 mb-4">Home Types We Build in Ashiyana</h3>
          <ul class="benefits-list">
            <li><strong>Ground Floor Homes:</strong> Ideal for smaller plots, with provision for future upward extension built into the structural design from day one.</li>
            <li><strong>Double Storey Homes (G+1):</strong> Separate living areas on each floor, popular with joint families sharing a single plot.</li>
            <li><strong>Builder Floor Apartments:</strong> For larger plots where you want to occupy one floor and generate rental income from another.</li>
            <li><strong>Duplex Homes:</strong> Two independent units on one plot. See our <a href="/services/duplex-construction-company-in-lucknow/">duplex construction services in Lucknow</a>.</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="internal-links-section mt-8">
            <p>More services from VP Infra:</p>
            <ul class="related-links">
              <li><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-lucknow/">Building construction company in Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/services/residential-construction-services-in-lucknow/">Residential construction services in Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/services/turnkey-building-contractors-in-lucknow/">Turnkey building contractors in Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/services/commercial-construction-company-in-lucknow/">Commercial construction company in Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/about-us/">About VP Infra</a></li>
              <li><a href="/blog/">Read our construction blog</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8"><a href="/contact-us/" class="btn btn-primary">Book a Free Site Visit</a></div>
        </div>

        <div class="service-image fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
          <img src="/images/custom_home_builders_ashiyana_lucknow.webp" alt="Custom Home Builders in Ashiyana Lucknow — couple discussing floor plans with VP Infra architect" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Everything You Need to Know -->
  <section class="know-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="know-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">Everything You Need to Know</h2>
        <p class="know-subtitle">Key facts about building a custom home in Ashiyana Colony, Lucknow — approvals, Vastu, timelines, and plot rules.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="know-stats">
        <div class="know-stat"><span class="know-stat-value">7–10</span><span class="know-stat-desc">Months, ground floor</span></div>
        <div class="know-stat"><span class="know-stat-value">3</span><span class="know-stat-desc">Floor plan options provided</span></div>
        <div class="know-stat"><span class="know-stat-value">LDA</span><span class="know-stat-desc">Approval managed by us</span></div>
        <div class="know-stat"><span class="know-stat-value">Vastu</span><span class="know-stat-desc">Compliant designs available</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="know-grid">
        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">📋</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>LDA Permits for Ashiyana Plots</h3>
            <p>Ashiyana Colony falls under LDA jurisdiction. All new residential construction requires an approved building plan before foundation work begins. VP Infra prepares architectural drawings to LDA specifications, submits the permit application, and follows up through the approval cycle on your behalf. Most Ashiyana approvals are obtained within 6 to 10 weeks when documentation is complete.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">🧭</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Vastu-Compliant Design</h3>
            <p>A significant number of Ashiyana families request Vastu-compliant homes. VP Infra treats Vastu as a design parameter from the floor plan stage, not an afterthought. Our architects are familiar with Vastu guidelines for room orientation, main entrance placement, kitchen direction, and staircase positioning — balancing these with structural requirements from day one.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">🗓️</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Construction Timelines</h3>
            <p>A custom ground floor home in Ashiyana takes 7 to 10 months from LDA approval to final handover. A G+1 structure of similar footprint takes 12 to 16 months. The design and approval phase before construction begins takes an additional 8 to 14 weeks. VP Infra provides a monthly milestone schedule at contract signing so your family can plan around the build with confidence.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">📐</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Minimum Plot Size Rules</h3>
            <p>LDA rules allow residential construction on plots as small as 50 sq yards in approved layouts like Ashiyana Colony. However, setback requirements and ground coverage limits restrict usable built-up area significantly on very small plots. On a 50 sq yard plot, you can typically build around 280 to 320 sq ft on the ground floor. VP Infra advises on maximum permissible FAR before any design is finalised.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">🏘️</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Builder Floor with Rental Income</h3>
            <p>Many Ashiyana residents build on one floor and rent out another. VP Infra designs these with separate entrances, independent utility provisions, and soundproofing between floors. The LDA building plan is submitted showing the multi-unit layout, which is permitted under residential zoning in Ashiyana Colony. This arrangement helps families offset construction loan EMIs with rental income.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card know-card-highlight">
          <div class="know-icon">📍</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>We Are Right Here in Ashiyana</h3>
            <p>VP Infra's office at M-652, Sector-M, Ashiyana Colony means your project always has a locally based team — no long commutes, no remote coordination delays. A branch office at Khazana Complex, Ashiyana Colony provides a second point of contact. If you need a <a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-lucknow/">building construction company in Lucknow</a> nearby, our team can visit your plot within 48 hours.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="faq-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title text-center mb-8">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Can VP Infra design a Vastu-compliant home in Ashiyana?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. VP Infra incorporates Vastu Shastra principles into residential designs when clients request it. Vastu compliance is treated as a design parameter from the floor plan stage, not added as an afterthought. This ensures structural and spatial requirements are balanced with Vastu preferences without compromising either.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>How long does custom home construction take in Ashiyana?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>A custom ground floor home in Ashiyana typically takes 7 to 10 months from LDA approval to final handover. A G+1 structure of similar footprint takes 12 to 16 months. The design and approval phase adds 8 to 14 weeks. VP Infra provides a monthly milestone schedule at contract signing.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Does VP Infra help with LDA building permission for Ashiyana plots?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. LDA building permission is a standard part of VP Infra's service. Their team prepares architectural drawings to LDA specifications, submits the building permission application, handles any clarifications raised by the authority, and receives the approved map on your behalf. VP Infra's Ashiyana-based office means they understand the specific local requirements well.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>What is the minimum plot size for custom home construction in Ashiyana?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>LDA allows residential construction on plots as small as 50 sq yards in approved layouts like Ashiyana Colony. On very small plots, setback requirements and ground coverage limits restrict the usable built-up area. VP Infra advises on maximum permissible FAR and ground coverage before finalising any design.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Can I build a house with a rental unit in Ashiyana Colony?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. Builder floor construction, where you occupy one floor and rent another, is common in Ashiyana. VP Infra designs these with separate entrances, independent utilities, and soundproofing between floors. The LDA building plan is submitted showing the multi-unit configuration, which is permitted under residential zoning in Ashiyana Colony.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Which is the best custom home builder in Ashiyana, Lucknow?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>VP Infra Properties (OPC) Pvt. Ltd. is based in Ashiyana Colony itself. They offer ISO 9001:2015 certified construction, MSME registration, local LDA approval expertise, and direct client communication throughout the project. Their office at Sector-M and branch at Khazana Complex make them the most accessible option for Ashiyana residents planning to build.</p></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section text-center">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Build Your Dream Home in Ashiyana, Lucknow</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 mb-8">VP Infra is right here in Ashiyana Colony. Call us or walk in — we will visit your plot and give you an honest plan that fits your budget.</p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="/contact-us/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get a Free Consultation</a>
        <a href="tel:8840069902" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Call: 8840069902</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header { background-size: cover; background-position: center; color: var(--text-light); padding: 8rem 0 6rem; }
  .page-header h1 { color: var(--text-light); font-size: 3.5rem; }
  .service-grid { grid-template-columns: 3fr 2fr; align-items: start; padding: 4rem 0; }
  @media (max-width: 992px) { .service-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .page-header h1 { font-size: 2.4rem; } }
  .service-image img { width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }
  .benefits-list { list-style: none; }
  .benefits-list li { position: relative; padding-left: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--text-gray); }
  .benefits-list li::before { content: '🏡'; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; }
  .benefits-list strong { color: var(--secondary); }
  .related-links { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .related-links li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .related-links a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline; }
  .internal-links-section { border-top: 1px solid #e0e7f0; padding-top: 1.5rem; }
  .internal-links-section p { font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-dark); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .know-section { padding: 5rem 0; background: #f4f7fb; }
  .know-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .know-subtitle { color: var(--text-gray); font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 0.6rem; max-width: 600px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
  .know-stats { display: flex; justify-content: center; background: var(--primary); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .know-stat { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding: 1.4rem 1rem; border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }
  .know-stat:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .know-stat-value { font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif; }
  .know-stat-desc { font-size: 0.78rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); margin-top: 0.2rem; text-align: center; }
  .know-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .know-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .know-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .know-stats { flex-wrap: wrap; } .know-stat { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); flex: 1 1 45%; } }
  .know-card { background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.8rem 1.6rem; display: flex; gap: 1.1rem; box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-left: 3px solid var(--primary); transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease; }
  .know-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.11); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .know-card-highlight { border-left-color: var(--secondary); background: #fffaf4; }
  .know-icon { font-size: 1.7rem; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1; margin-top: 0.1rem; }
  .know-card-body h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.55rem; }
  .know-card-body p { font-size: 0.93rem; color: var(--text-gray); line-height: 1.72; margin: 0; }
  .know-card-body a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline; }
  .faq-section { padding: 4rem 0; background: #fff; }
  .faq-list { max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .faq-item { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e0e7f0; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 1rem; overflow: hidden; }
  .faq-item summary { padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; color: var(--primary); list-style: none; }
  .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .faq-answer { padding: 0 1.5rem 1.2rem; color: var(--text-gray); line-height: 1.75; }
  .cta-section { padding: 5rem 0; background: var(--primary); color: #fff; }
  .cta-section h2 { color: #fff; font-size: 2.2rem; }
  .cta-section p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .cta-buttons { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-lg { padding: 1rem 2.2rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .btn-secondary { background: transparent; border: 2px solid #fff; color: #fff; }
</style>
